Enable the Admin UI controls for the features premium-features.patch unlocks.
The dashboard locks them from the `premium_user` claim in its session token,
which stays false; these components ignore it instead of flipping the claim,
so screens whose backends are stripped or harmful stay locked (audit log
viewer, UI access control, allowed IPs, email branding, organizations).

- Per-model budgets for users, keys, and teams (ModelMaxBudgetEditor).
- Key create and edit: policies, prompts, allowed pass-through routes,
  logging callbacks; key regeneration on the key page and chat "Rotate".
- Team create and edit: secret manager settings, disable global guardrails
  (still proxy admin only on the server), allowed pass-through routes,
  logging callbacks.
- Pass-through endpoint auth toggle, which the proxy already honors.
- Region outage alerts switch.

Checks: tests/verify_premium_ui.integration.test.tsx

